      "extract": "The original volume conjecture only held for a special root of unity $q = e^{\\frac{2\\pi i}{N}}$. In order to generalize to arbitrary $q=e^{\\frac{2\\pi i}{k}}$, the appropriate limit to consider is $$k\\to\\infty\\,,\\qquad N\\to\\infty\\,,\\qquad u := i\\pi\\frac { N} k \\quad\\text{fixed}\\, \\label{lim}$$ (or $q\\to 1$, $q^N = e^{2u}$ fixed). The question, then, is how to understand $$\\lim_{k,N\\to\\infty} J_N(K;q)^{1/k}\\quad ?$$",
